# 🚀 OctoMatrix Hardened Git Exclusion Policy

# [Global Exclusions] Effective in any directory
**/__pycache__/
**/.env*
**/.flask_port*
**/.last_source*
**/.router_port*
**/.runtime_state*
**/.last_update*
**/.telegram_offset*
**/*.log*
**/*.token*
**/*.secret*
**/*.bak*
**/*.tmp*

# [Specific Directories and Data] Physical isolation
/agent_home/
/docker-deploy/container_home/

# [Dynamic Config and Build Files] Hardened exclusions
/docker-deploy/config.*.yaml
/docker-deploy/awake.*.yaml
/docker-deploy/docker-compose.*.yml
/docker-deploy/dynamic_*.sh
/docker-deploy/dynamic_*.txt

# [Configs and Credentials] Maximum leakage prevention
/config.yaml*
/awake.yaml*

# [Skill Packages] Local shared space only
/skills/*.tar.gz
/skills/*.zip

# OctoMatrix Global Skill Cache
skills/.global_skills_cache/
